<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-AUSTRIA BEAT SOUTH AFRICA 3-2 IN FED CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRIA BEAT SOUTH AFRICA 3-2 IN FED CUP.</headline>
<dateline>POERTSCHACH, Austria 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria beat South</p>
<p>Africa 3-2 after the reserved singles and double matches on the</p>
<p>second day of their Fed Cup Group two play-off tie on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results:  Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat Barbara Paulus</p>
<p>(Austria) 6-2 6-0</p>
<p>Barbara Schett (Austria) beat Joannette Kruger (South Africa)</p>
<p>4-6 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Barbara Schett/Judith Wiesner (Austria) beat Amanda</p>
<p>Coetzer/Jessica Steck 6-1 6-1</p>
</text>
